# @dafne/<%= a.kebab %>

A Dafne frontend (Next.js), generated by `dafne g frontend-app` and set up
like `apps/sales-web`: sign-in through `apps/auth`, account page, sidebar,
English and Italian. Rules are in `CLAUDE.md`.

```bash
cp apps/<%= a.kebab %>/.env.example apps/<%= a.kebab %>/.env
pnpm dafne dev @dafne/auth @dafne/<%= a.kebab %>   # plus its API
pnpm dafne g frontend-resource invoice --app <%= a.kebab %>
```

It runs on http://localhost:<%= port %>: add that URL to `TRUSTED_ORIGINS`
of `apps/auth`.
